From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koyu <me@koyu.space>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:17:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] Remove the KDE mascots

Konqi on the finished page becomes BlossomOS Recovery's green check
badge, and the application icon the BlossomOS logo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
